  "Place 2, then 3 neutral markers before choosing characters. You must also beat the neutral stack to act; the matching character lets you tie it. Available characters change each round. Boats cannot end their movement on the same space.": "選擇角色前，先放置2個、再放置3個中立標記。要行動還必須超過中立堆疊；對應角色可讓你與之平手。可用角色每回合更換。船隻不能結束在相同格子上。",
  "Place five markers and understand action majorities.": "放置五個標記並了解行動多數。",
